:"ma4: the static profile through a module.

   kgpy compile c static/ma4.kg must resolve stats.ma4 at compile time: stats
   is bound once by .l to a module, which cannot be changed, so the
   call names one function in lib/stats.kg. The function is compiled as if
   it were written here, under the name stats.ma4. Nothing else in lib/stats.kg
   is reachable from the entry, so none of it is checked."

.l("../lib/stats")

run(v)::{stats.ma4(v)}

.entry("run";"float[16] -> float[13]")
